Run as a normal user. Upon first run, answer:
- configure automatically? -> yes (press Enter)
- What approach do you want? -> type "manual"

NOTE!
That's an unofficial update, made by Claude. Changes:

1) Download link (now line 146): https://cpan.metacpan.org/authors/id/..., 
with the version matched literally (\Q...\E).

2) URL (now lines 166–168): always https://metacpan.org/dist/<Name>,
replacing the old chain that ended at the dead search.cpan.org.

3) .md5sum removed (old lines 311–331 and use Digest::MD5). The final
message now says to run pkgmk -us in the new port to create its .signature.
